WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
But also, in the past, Brazil — can you believe this?

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.000
— unfairly tariffed our nation.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.800
But now, because of our tariffs, we are hitting them back,

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.640
and we're hitting them back very hard.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:13.800
As President, I will always defend our national sovereignty

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.799
and the rights of American citizens.

00:00:16.799 --> 00:00:18.799
So —

